# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:14
translate italian tammy0_cb155259:

    # "I walk up to the counter to order and the barista comes over and smiles at me. Her nametag says Tammy."
    "Mi avvicino al bancone per ordinare e la barista si avvicina e mi sorride. Sul suo cartellino c'è scritto Tammy."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:15
translate italian tammy0_960c569d:

    # tm "Hey, what can I get for you?"
    tm "Ehi, cosa posso darti?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:16
translate italian tammy0_fa6b38f1:

    # pc "A vanilla latte sounds great."
    pc "Un latte alla vaniglia mi sembra perfetto."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:17
translate italian tammy0_7d493d63:

    # tm "Sure, give me just a minute."
    tm "Certo, dammi solo un minuto."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:20
translate italian tammy0_8d2f03a3:

    # "As she's making the drink, Tammy keeps stealing glances at me out of the corner of her eye."
    "Mentre prepara la bevanda, Tammy continua a lanciarmi sguardi furtivi con la coda dell'occhio."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:23
translate italian tammy0_dab90305:

    # tm "Do I know you from somewhere?"
    tm "Ti ho già visto da qualche parte?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:24
translate italian tammy0_9b99e681:

    # pc "Maybe? I used to live here, but I moved to Brazil for college for a few years."
    pc "Forse? Una volta vivevo qui, ma mi sono trasferita in Brasile per l’università per qualche anno."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:27
translate italian tammy0_ad258c61:

    # tm "That's right! Oh my God, you're Suzy's [brother], that's how I know you!"
    tm "Ma certo! Oh mio Dio, sei la [brother] di Suzy, ecco perché ti riconosco!"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:29
translate italian tammy0_98a6f6cd:

    # tm "You don't remember me at all do you?"
    tm "Non ti ricordi proprio di me, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:30
translate italian tammy0_cd371745:

    # "I think about it real hard for a moment, then shake my head."
    "Ci penso intensamente per un attimo, poi scuoto la testa."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:31
translate italian tammy0_d5c0236e:

    # pc "Sorry, I don't."
    pc "Mi dispiace, proprio no."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:32
translate italian tammy0_b2610fc1:

    # tm "Me and Suzy have been best friends for like ten years."
    tm "Io e Suzy siamo migliori amiche da tipo dieci anni."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:33
translate italian tammy0_847614bb:

    # tm "I used to spend the night over at your house all the time."
    tm "Passavo sempre la notte a casa tua."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:34
translate italian tammy0_3c49bd2b:

    # pc "Wait a minute, that was you?"
    pc "Aspetta un attimo, quella eri tu?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:36
translate italian tammy0_2192d640:

    # tm "Yep!"
    tm "Sì!"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:37
translate italian tammy0_b5a15098:

    # "I try to think back. I remember Suzy having a friend over all the time, but I couldn't remember her name."
    "Provo a ripensarci. Ricordo che Suzy aveva sempre un'amica a casa, ma non riuscivo a ricordarmi il suo nome."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:38
translate italian tammy0_9a237cb9:

    # "She was a chunky little acne-faced kid though, nothing like this woman in front of me now."
    "Era una ragazzina paffuta con la faccia piena di brufoli, però, niente a che vedere con questa donna che ho davanti adesso."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:39
translate italian tammy0_b0e79f9b:

    # pc "I do remember you now, but you look a lot different."
    pc "Ora mi ricordo di te, ma sei molto cambiato."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:41
translate italian tammy0_cff01a94:

    # tm "I got hot, huh?"
    tm "Sono arrossita, eh?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:42
translate italian tammy0_1ca45f42:

    # pc "Well, yeah."
    pc "Beh, sì."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:44
translate italian tammy0_0a135303:

    # tm "You know I used to have the biggest crush on you."
    tm "Sai, avevo una cotta pazzesca per te."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:45
translate italian tammy0_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:46
translate italian tammy0_ea5eb3da:

    # tm "Oh yeah. When I was 15, you were like the sexiest guy in the world to me."
    tm "Oh sì. Quando avevo 15 anni, per me eri il ragazzo più sexy del mondo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:47
translate italian tammy0_dd31869f:

    # pc "Wow, that's crazy."
    pc "Wow, è pazzesco."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:49
translate italian tammy0_f9e3ebc2:

    # tm "Still pretty sexy, I have to say."
    tm "Sei ancora piuttosto sexy, devo ammetterlo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:50
translate italian tammy0_c693fb0a:

    # "My face grows hot."
    "Mi si scalda il viso."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:52
translate italian tammy0_111d808d:

    # tm "Sorry, I'm not trying to embarrass you."
    tm "Scusa, non volevo metterti in imbarazzo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:53
translate italian tammy0_ea9445fd:

    # tm "Anyways, this one is on me, just because it's nice to see you again. Hope you enjoy the latte."
    tm "Comunque, questo lo offro io, solo perché è bello rivederti. Spero che il latte ti piaccia."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:54
translate italian tammy0_ba613065:

    # pc "Oh thank you, it's good to see you again too."
    pc "Oh grazie, è bello rivedere anche te."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:55
translate italian tammy0_ded59627:

    # tm "Come back and see me."
    tm "Torna a trovarmi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:56
translate italian tammy0_3410e17e:

    # pc "I will. Thanks again."
    pc "Lo farò. Grazie ancora."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:57
translate italian tammy0_ebf00fdb:

    # "I give her a smile and then take my drink and head out."
    "Le faccio un sorriso, poi prendo la mia bevanda e me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:59
translate italian tammy0_5f3f90f4:

    # "She had a crush on me?"
    "Aveva una cotta per me?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:60
translate italian tammy0_dcdd1233:

    # "I wonder if she still does. Maybe I should try to talk to her more sometime?"
    "Chissà se ce l’ha ancora. Forse dovrei provare a parlarle di più qualche volta?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:61
translate italian tammy0_f54a8995:

    # "I mean, she's Suzy's best friend, but she's pretty hot. There's nothing weird about that right?"
    "Insomma, è la migliore amica di Suzy, ma è davvero carina. Non c’è niente di strano in questo, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:62
translate italian tammy0_37b8db91:

    # "She lingers in my mind as I head out to my car."
    "Mi rimane in mente mentre mi dirigo verso la mia auto."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy0.rpy:66
translate italian tammy0_ac438237:

    # "I drive off to school."
    "Parto in auto per andare a scuola."

